<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $63-1/4 (FIM 298.74).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $63-1/4 (FIM 298.74).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed flat at $63-1/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 298.74 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed up 0.50 markka at 297.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended $0-5/8 lower at $34-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 82.10 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.50 markka at 81.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Monday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up one markka at 94.00.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
